{"4833490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mahjong Nook", "steam_appid": 4833490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong: the original family drama simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Nook is the real tile game, not the matching puzzle you've seen everywhere else. Settle into a cozy 3D nook that feels like Sunday at grandma's, minus the unsolicited life advice of eating too little while being simultaneously too fat. Draw, discard, and fight for that winning hand across multiple rulesets: Hong Kong, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to mahjong? We'll teach you. Already a pro? Invite someone and prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn it. Love it. Never let your friends or family win again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL MAHJONG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matching here. No exploding gems. Just traditional mahjong, faithfully recreated and ready for your next rivalry with family (or friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/08ea0552edcdce0d5dd0fa3ccb754663.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/08ea0552edcdce0d5dd0fa3ccb754663.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/08ea0552edcdce0d5dd0fa3ccb754663.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE RULESETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every family swears their version of mahjong is the correct one. Learn Hong Kong, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and more. Then beat them at their own rules and take their candy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/0201068e1f280ef38a832d5e192914fe.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/0201068e1f280ef38a832d5e192914fe.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/0201068e1f280ef38a832d5e192914fe.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEARN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watched <i>Crazy Rich Asians</i>? Watched everyone else play but never got invited because nobody had the patience to teach you? Now's your chance! Learn at your own pace, then show up to the next gathering with no mercy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS or not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't go outside and touch grass. Play with up to 3 friends or even just 1. You can even meet new rivals (or friends) online! Whether you're here to relax or ruin friendships, we don't judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style with mahjong skins, player titles, win animations, and more. Because if you're going to win, you might as well look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real mahjong, not the matching kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple rulesets: Hong Kong, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to play tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun included. Family arguments are BYO.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong: the original family drama simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Nook is the real tile game, not the matching puzzle you've seen everywhere else. Settle into a cozy 3D nook that feels like Sunday at grandma's, minus the unsolicited life advice of eating too little while being simultaneously too fat. Draw, discard, and fight for that winning hand across multiple rulesets: Hong Kong, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to mahjong? We'll teach you. Already a pro? Invite someone and prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn it. Love it. Never let your friends or family win again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/23bb5a0bb1749bd594eb065a1ecaf9ef.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL MAHJONG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matching here. No exploding gems. Just traditional mahjong, faithfully recreated and ready for your next rivalry with family (or friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://