xtras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/c553c0c1e67d39d11d8265ae4e0ad035.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS or not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't go outside and touch grass. Play with up to 3 friends or even just 1. You can even meet new rivals (or friends) online! Whether you're here to relax or ruin friendships, we don't judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.poster.avif?t=1786421154\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.webm?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/extras/b249d228ac541d11ba6e3bd3a5fcbff2.mp4?t=1786421154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style with mahjong skins, player titles, win animations, and more. Because if you're going to win, you might as well look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real mahjong, not the matching kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple rulesets: Hong Kong, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to play tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun included. Family arguments are BYO.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mahjong Nook is a cozy 3D mahjong game, and yes, it's the real one. Not the matching puzzle. Draw, discard, and fight for the winning hand across authentic Asian rulesets solo or online. Time to learn and outplay your friends.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/ff3a52882fb249a3de9f8206b312fc3fd97830d4/header.jpg?t=1786421154", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/423c1cbde5666dc67fd91ae4ef16d5b379323898/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786421154", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4833490/423c1cbde5666dc67fd91ae4ef16d5b379323898/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786421154", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 / NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 (DirectX 11 capable, 1 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD